  "html": "<p>上週六06/20由科管所陳曉慧教授邀請了美國訴訟律師Christopher E. Hanba針對近期廣明與HP的訴訟案件進行演講，並由EMRD兼任教師的楊芝青律師擔任現場口譯與陳教授共同主持。</p>\n<p>討論主題-<strong>廣明案對台灣公司營運之啟示 HP v. Quanta Storage – Takeaways for Taiwanese Companies</strong></p>\n<p>除現場與美國的遠距連線討論外，也同步開放同學參與線上連線研討會。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"109.06.20廣明案對台灣公司營運之啟示\" height=\"309\" src=\"/legacy/img/17a87c414a-s-4939837.png\" width=\"800\"><br> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E6%8E%A2%E8%A8%8E?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARBDorhqgCs0Nbupuv8H6glrn1wSVLc4YMVk79EMV2lExduJ1ac-cWWhbLvhsHAB8IccsyZt1tJetEp0fLQF2xTosteuFp_mcj5FzCdPmb35xWFqq3E0IRXGgr_Y7NpOeSBVdSP4cKmnEvYHArO_G7QjclM-yjnKR9WUc6zQLz63YZkFyq24gnE0vLzcf_dXlcR10mTtWWbRJPE0QrLwCg3_4agMD7jc3mm_Dbu5RdPfGFAf7x27cFE4tyfMizQ3jzKB_sChWsgb9E0LmtilLmhjjp-YsGZjhjX19x9wuLWIzZOA3xQbo9TQRRaE_1-JnoeNj86L4QZRoXORdIKbREp78fZ3&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#時事探討</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/emrd?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARBDorhqgCs0Nbupuv8H6glrn1wSVLc4YMVk79EMV2lExduJ1ac-cWWhbLvhsHAB8IccsyZt1tJetEp0fLQF2xTosteuFp_mcj5FzCdPmb35xWFqq3E0IRXGgr_Y7NpOeSBVdSP4cKmnEvYHArO_G7QjclM-yjnKR9WUc6zQLz63YZkFyq24gnE0vLzcf_dXlcR10mTtWWbRJPE0QrLwCg3_4agMD7jc3mm_Dbu5RdPfGFAf7x27cFE4tyfMizQ3jzKB_sChWsgb9E0LmtilLmhjjp-YsGZjhjX19x9wuLWIzZOA3xQbo9TQRRaE_1-JnoeNj86L4QZRoXORdIKbREp78fZ3&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#EMRD</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E9%81%A0%E8%B7%9D%E9%80%A3%E7%B7%9A?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARBDorhqgCs0Nbupuv8H6glrn1wSVLc4YMVk79EMV2lExduJ1ac-cWWhbLvhsHAB8IccsyZt1tJetEp0fLQF2xTosteuFp_mcj5FzCdPmb35xWFqq3E0IRXGgr_Y7NpOeSBVdSP4cKmnEvYHArO_G7QjclM-yjnKR9WUc6zQLz63YZkFyq24gnE0vLzcf_dXlcR10mTtWWbRJPE0QrLwCg3_4agMD7jc3mm_Dbu5RdPfGFAf7x27cFE4tyfMizQ3jzKB_sChWsgb9E0LmtilLmhjjp-YsGZjhjX19x9wuLWIzZOA3xQbo9TQRRaE_1-JnoeNj86L4QZRoXORdIKbREp78fZ3&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#國際遠距連線</a></p>",
